page_head #= language_theme_head

#[navbar]

#[section, $md:
    @../ (Documentation) / Resources and Path values

    # Resources and Path values

    Projects contain more than source. Images, fonts, stylesheets and data files
    need to reach the output, and the links pointing at them need to be correct
    from wherever they are read.

    Moth handles this with one small surface. A resource path names a file, the
    compiler validates it, and a `Path` value carries it until a builder decides
    where the file lands and what the URL should say.
]

